{
  "sections": {
    "main-collection-banner": {
      "type": "main-collection-banner",
      "settings": {
        "show_collection_description": true,
        "show_collection_image": true,
        "color_scheme": "background-1"
      }
    },
    "main-collection-product-grid": {
      "type": "main-collection-product-grid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "settings": {
        "products_per_page": 20,
        "columns_desktop": 2,
        "stretch_cards": false,
        "image_ratio": "portrait",
        "show_secondary_image": true,
        "badges": "disabled",
        "show_vendor": false,
        "show_rating": false,
        "enable_quick_add": false,
        "swatches_option_name": "",
        "swatches_position": "top",
        "swatches_desktop_size": 36,
        "swatches_mobile_size": 24,
        "enable_filtering": false,
        "filter_type": "horizontal",
        "enable_sorting": false,
        "columns_mobile": "1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 88
      }
    },
    "argumentaire": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "h": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Deux aciers, pliés l'un dans l'autre",
            "title_highlight_1_color": "#A9BEC6"
          }
        },
        "t1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Le damas n'est pas une nuance d'acier, c'est une construction. Deux nuances soudées à la forge, pliées l'une dans l'autre, puis révélées à l'acide. Le dessin qui apparaît est la trace du pliage.</p><p>Il traverse toute l'épaisseur de la lame et reste visible sur la tranche, jusqu'au fil.</p>",
            "alignment": "left"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "h",
        "t1"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/yuro-forge-pliage.png",
        "height": "medium",
        "layout": "text_first",
        "desktop_media_width": 50,
        "content_layout": "no-overlap",
        "desktop_content_position": "middle",
        "desktop_content_alignment": "left",
        "mobile_content_alignment": "left",
        "mobile_direction": "normal",
        "color_scheme": "background-2",
        "section_color_scheme": "background-2",
        "desktop_padding_top": 72,
        "desktop_padding_bottom": 72,
        "mobile_padding_top": 48,
        "mobile_padding_bottom": 48
      }
    },
    "prochaine_serie": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "display_id": false,
        "visibility": "always-display",
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"page-width\">\n  <div class=\"da-serie\">\n    <p class=\"da-serie__eyebrow\">Prochainement</p>\n    <h2 class=\"da-serie__titre\">Une autre série est en cours de forge</h2>\n    <p class=\"da-serie__texte\">Elle sortira de l'atelier en quantité limitée, comme les précédentes. Laissez votre adresse si vous voulez être prévenu le jour de la mise en ligne. Vous ne recevrez que ce message, rien d'autre.</p>\n    {%- form 'customer', class: 'da-serie__form' -%}\n      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"contact[tags]\" value=\"prochaine-serie\">\n      <label class=\"visually-hidden\" for=\"da-serie-email\">Adresse e-mail</label>\n      <input\n        id=\"da-serie-email\"\n        class=\"da-serie__champ\"\n        type=\"email\"\n        name=\"contact[email]\"\n        value=\"{{ form.email }}\"\n        placeholder=\"Votre adresse e-mail\"\n        autocomplete=\"email\"\n        required\n      >\n      <button class=\"da-serie__bouton\" type=\"submit\">Prévenez-moi</button>\n      {%- if form.errors -%}\n        <p class=\"da-serie__retour da-serie__erreur\">{{ form.errors.translated_fields.email }} {{ form.errors.messages.email }}</p>\n      {%- elsif form.posted_successfully? -%}\n        <p class=\"da-serie__retour\">C'est noté. Vous serez prévenu à la sortie.</p>\n      {%- endif -%}\n    {%- endform -%}\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 8,
        "padding_bottom": 80
      }
    }
  },
  "order": [
    "main-collection-banner",
    "main-collection-product-grid",
    "argumentaire",
    "prochaine_serie"
  ]
}
